Third-party components
----------------------

The following files are derived from external open-source projects and retain
their original licensing terms:

- `tgnnet/models/backbone.py` — Res2Net
  (https://github.com/Res2Net/Res2Net-PretrainedModels)

- `eval/StructureMeasure.m`, `eval/S_object.m`, `eval/S_region.m`,
  `eval/original_WFb.m`, `eval/Enhancedmeasure.m`, `eval/CalMAE.m` — the
  foreground-map evaluation toolbox by Deng-Ping Fan et al., provided for
  academic purposes only. Please cite the corresponding papers:
  - Structure-measure, ICCV 2017
  - Enhanced-alignment measure, IJCAI 2018
  - Weighted F-measure (Margolin et al.), CVPR 2014
